WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:11.646
We run on the track.

2
00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:22.591
We climb up and down.

3
00:00:22.592 --> 00:00:38.179
We turn around.

4
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:52.373
We blow bubbles.

5
00:00:52.374 --> 00:01:08.140
We go through the tunnel.

6
00:01:08.141 --> 00:01:18.577
We touch the pole.

7
00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:39.602
We shoot the ball.

8
00:01:39.603 --> 00:01:51.611
We wave our hands.

9
00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:57.843
We smile.

